<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean 3-year yields end flat, CD yields down.</title>
<headline>S.Korean 3-year yields end flat, CD yields down.</headline>
<text>
<p>Yields on three-year benchmark corporate bonds closed flat on Thursday as most investors stayed uninterested amid the lack of clear market direction, traders said.</p>
<p>But yields on three-month certificates of deposit (CDs) fell on scanty new issues and renewed buying.</p>
<p>* 3-yr corporates close unchanged at 11.97 pct</p>
<p>* 3-mth CDs end at 12.50 pct vs 12.55 pct</p>
<p>* Overnight average call rates at 12.3 pct vs 12.5 pct</p>
</text>
